{"data": [{"author_id": "94039619", "created_at": "2026-11-03T01:08:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117423673699340521"], "id": "2117423673699340521", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1745106082790318080", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117407009196675236", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@SemiAnalysis_ -60% 수익률이 날때 삼성은 -30% 였죠. 흔들다리가 출렁이는건 바람 때문 아니라 다리 위의 누군가 당신을 죽으려고 하는 걸 수도 있습니다. 👿", "url": "https://x.com/zupet0/status/2117423673699340521"}, {"author_id": "2110142755238281216", "created_at": "2026-11-03T01:03:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117422270817964055"], "id": "2117422270817964055", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1745106082790318080", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117407007829303721", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@SemiAnalysis_ 80% must be top! Like the attractiveness is to expand and capture even one third of this margin", "url": "https://x.com/MortisExsul/status/2117422270817964055"}, {"author_id": "1970198953586233344", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:59:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117421410415194407"], "id": "2117421410415194407", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1745106082790318080", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117407009196675236", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@SemiAnalysis_ 20% increase from 2018 is not a big increase given the AI hype.\n\nthe issue though is that the extra DRAM that’s going into data centers with GPUs is being wasted to create an artificial billing strategy for token generation at 1000 in the data centre and 50 on-device per second", "url": "https://x.com/kdapillay/status/2117421410415194407"}, {"author_id": "2082166640767123456", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:57:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117420925830283631"], "id": "2117420925830283631", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1745106082790318080", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117407011943952876", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@SemiAnalysis_ The market has priced in a crash in DRAM that just wont happen", "url": "https://x.com/Future_Ripples/status/2117420925830283631"}, {"author_id": "2055959144981504000", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:50:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117419212260163957"], "id": "2117419212260163957", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1745106082790318080", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117407011943952876", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@SemiAnalysis_ Samsung bracing for a worse 2027", "url": "https://x.com/Eliopyr/status/2117419212260163957"}, {"author_id": "2058004193583955968", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:48:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117418602865307785"], "id": "2117418602865307785", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1745106082790318080", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117407011943952876", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@SemiAnalysis_ What do you think?", "url": "https://x.com/thee_bad_guy8/status/2117418602865307785"}, {"author_id": "131408858", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:41:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117416962389406050"], "id": "2117416962389406050", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1745106082790318080", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117407007829303721", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@SemiAnalysis_ 80% memory margins aren't just a cloud story. On RK-class edge boards it shows up as tiny DRAM budgets and NPU/CPU bandwidth fights. Agent swarms hit the memory wall long before the model wall.", "url": "https://x.com/RayJackChen/status/2117416962389406050"}, {"author_id": "1787280661365116929", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:40:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117416504073261472"], "id": "2117416504073261472", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1745106082790318080", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 109, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117407007829303721", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@SemiAnalysis_ They had long-term agreements going into 2022 too I think. When phone and PC demand fell, customers pushed out deliveries, the contracts bent, and margins still hit -60%. Half of 2027-28 under LTA mostly locks price until buyer inventory piles up.", "url": "https://x.com/variableacc/status/2117416504073261472"}, {"author_id": "1080160529757454336", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:39:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117416375421689876"], "id": "2117416375421689876", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1745106082790318080", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 213, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117407007829303721", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@SemiAnalysis_ 按帖里这组数字，营业利润率确实惊人。同样是做存储，周期不同，盈利的差别能大到这个程度。", "url": "https://x.com/kiriahempress/status/2117416375421689876"}, {"author_id": "2055959144981504000", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:38:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117415992460710370"], "id": "2117415992460710370", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1745106082790318080", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 238, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117407007829303721", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@SemiAnalysis_ from -67% in 1Q23 to this", "url": "https://x.com/Eliopyr/status/2117415992460710370"}, {"author_id": "799582756724416512", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:30:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117414098958942600"], "id": "2117414098958942600", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1745106082790318080", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 202, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117407007829303721", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@SemiAnalysis_ wait so at Micron the phone and laptop memory beats the HBM cloud stuff, 88 vs 76?? thought AI was the whole story", "url": "https://x.com/sanchitmonga22/status/2117414098958942600"}, {"author_id": "1911683712544018432", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:12:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117409501007552606"], "id": "2117409501007552606", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1745106082790318080", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 203, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117407007829303721", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@SemiAnalysis_ 80% margins on memory is wild tbh, feels like 2018 on steroids", "url": "https://x.com/MacroBombastic/status/2117409501007552606"}, {"author_id": "280086557", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:06:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117408062961246356"], "id": "2117408062961246356", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1745106082790318080", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 362, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117407007829303721", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@SemiAnalysis_ So is there Margin GAIN = DEMAND Destruction for AI GPU/CPU Components?", "url": "https://x.com/JP_Money_95630/status/2117408062961246356"}, {"author_id": "2381231357", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:05:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117407895583170719"], "id": "2117407895583170719", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1745106082790318080", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 309, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117407007829303721", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@SemiAnalysis_ I appreciate the care you take with the assumptions behind this investment case. Thanks to you and @Daniel_Lawson__ for encouraging that kind of thinking. It’s helped me ask more useful questions.", "url": "https://x.com/_Dopeshvt/status/2117407895583170719"}, {"author_id": "2086370229396111360", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:04:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117407627898691975"], "id": "2117407627898691975", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1745106082790318080", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117407007829303721", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@SemiAnalysis_ ~80% margins is the other half of Altman's \"your PC RAM is used 5% of the time\" line. Memory isn't scarce for PCs because it sits idle; it's scarce because whoever runs it 24/7 can outbid everyone. How much of that margin is HBM mix vs plain DRAM pricing?", "url": "https://x.com/miaojiang88/status/2117407627898691975"}, {"author_id": "2052583923918503944", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:03:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117407388399714646"], "id": "2117407388399714646", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1745106082790318080", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117407007829303721", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@SemiAnalysis_ The comparison with the 2018 peak is striking. The useful next question for AI infrastructure planning: how much of the capacity under long-term agreement can actually shift between HBM and conventional DRAM as demand changes?", "url": "https://x.com/liuzhao_666/status/2117407388399714646"}, {"author_id": "576187572", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:03:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117407347366912179"], "id": "2117407347366912179", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1745106082790318080", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 220, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117407007829303721", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@SemiAnalysis_ Should I wait for a point you’re trying to make or that’s it?", "url": "https://x.com/nuttsbyname/status/2117407347366912179"}, {"author_id": "1303012052412309504", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:03:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117407317172036069"], "id": "2117407317172036069", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1745106082790318080", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117407007829303721", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@SemiAnalysis_ You make the financial details easier to understand without oversimplifying them. Your account and @Daniel_Lawson__  are among the first I turn to when I want to learn more.", "url": "https://x.com/perfectscorpi0/status/2117407317172036069"}, {"author_id": "1745106082790318080", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:02:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117407011943952876"], "id": "2117407011943952876", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1745106082790318080", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 4096, "like_count": 21, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117407010585030983", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "Suppliers expect the shortage to last. SK hynix sees demand exceeding supply through 2030, with over half of its 2027-28 capacity under long-term agreements. Samsung expects the shortage to get worse in 2027. (4/4) \nhttps://t.co/aKKMh3y6OH", "url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2117407011943952876"}, {"author_id": "1745106082790318080", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:02:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117407010585030983"], "id": "2117407010585030983", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1745106082790318080", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 5727, "like_count": 19, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117407009196675236", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "The margins are broad-based, not only HBM. In Micron's latest quarter:\n\n🟠 Mobile &amp; Client: 88% operating margin\n🟠 Core Data Center: 85%\n🟠 Cloud Memory (HBM-heavy): 76%SK hynix expects the profitability gap between HBM and conventional DRAM to narrow meaningfully once 2027 HBM https://t.co/XEGGRqter5", "url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2117407010585030983"}, {"author_id": "1745106082790318080", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:02:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117407009196675236"], "id": "2117407009196675236", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1745106082790318080", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 2627, "like_count": 17, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117407007829303721", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "This is not a normal upcycle. In 1Q23, SK hynix and Micron posted -67% and -62% operating margins. At the 2018 supercycle peak, they topped out at 57% and 52%. Today both are more than 20 points above that peak. (2/4) https://t.co/ggO20TqBaP", "url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2117407009196675236"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "94039619", "name": "Kwonil Lee 이권일", "username": "zupet0"}, {"id": "2110142755238281216", "name": "Mortis II", "username": "MortisExsul"}, {"id": "1970198953586233344", "name": "Ken", "username": "kdapillay"}, {"id": "2082166640767123456", "name": "Steve", "username": "Future_Ripples"}, {"id": "2055959144981504000", "name": "Elio科技迷", "username": "Eliopyr"}, {"id": "2058004193583955968", "name": "Leo", "username": "thee_bad_guy8"}, {"id": "131408858", "name": "Dao", "username": "RayJackChen"}, {"id": "1787280661365116929", "name": "Variable (e/acc)", "username": "variableacc"}, {"id": "1080160529757454336", "name": "阿哲聊芯片", "username": "kiriahempress"}, {"id": "799582756724416512", "name": "Sanchit monga", "username": "sanchitmonga22"}, {"id": "1911683712544018432", "name": "Macro Bombastic", "username": "MacroBombastic"}, {"id": "280086557", "name": "Jim", "username": "JP_Money_95630"}, {"id": "2381231357", "name": "Philip Lawson", "username": "_Dopeshvt"}, {"id": "2086370229396111360", "name": "AnAn❤️", "username": "miaojiang88"}, {"id": "2052583923918503944", "name": "刘朝 Zhao Liu", "username": "liuzhao_666"}, {"id": "576187572", "name": "Nutsi", "username": "nuttsbyname"}, {"id": "1303012052412309504", "name": "Alexander Graham", "username": "perfectscorpi0"}, {"id": "1745106082790318080", "name": "SemiAnalysis", "username": "SemiAnalysis_"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2117423673699340521", "next_token": "b26v89c19zqg8o3juzlyidkoenb7eybughdc838b1ziil", "oldest_id": "2117407009196675236", "result_count": 21}}